        "place-victim :parameters (?holder - (either actor character) ?held - character ?p - place ?destination - place) :precondition (and (henchman ?holder) (has ?holder ?held) (at ?holder ?p) (connected ?destination ?p)) :effect (and (not (has ?holder ?held)) (at ?held ?destination) (captured ?held)))": "(:action place-victim :parameters (?holder - (either actor character) ?held - character ?p - place ?destination - place) :precondition (and (henchman ?holder) (has ?holder ?held) (at ?holder ?p) (connected ?destination ?p)) :effect (and (not (has ?holder ?held)) (at ?held ?destination) (captured ?held)))",
